==Strategy==
==='''Strategy 1 ([[Cheese]], Rush)'''===
{{Lineup
|Skelecat
|Necromancer Cat
|Mr.
|Manic Eraser Cat|40
|Courier Cat|40
|Awakened Bahamut Cat|30
}}

The aim of this strategy is to lock Casaurian Ahirujo behind the base and destroy the base before THE FOLIVOREAN spawns.

'''Battle:''' When the battle begins, wait until the first Ginger Snache reaches around halfway, then start spamming Manic Eraser and Courier, and keep doing this for the rest of the battle. As soon as you have money for it, spawn Awakened Bahamut Cat. Ahirujo should be locked behind the base and leave the base free for you to destroy it before THE FOLIVOREAN spawns.

